# error: 44:8: cannot move out of `(?s if c else ?t).items`: it is reached through `?s if c else ?t`, a view
# error: 49:8: cannot move out of `wrap(!s).items`: it is reached through `wrap(!s)`, a view
# error: 55:8: cannot move out of `ws.items`: `ws` is a view
# error: 57:8: cannot move out of `rs.items`: `rs` is a view
# error: 58:8: cannot move out of `rd(?mk(2)).items`: it is reached through `rd(?mk(2))`, a view
# error: 62:8: cannot move out of `rv[...]`: `rv` is a view
# error: 64:8: cannot move out of `wv[...]`: `wv` is a view
